description: OpenMarket backend conventions - naming, read models vs write aggregates, JSDoc typing. Applies to domain, application and infrastructure code.
globs: src/openMarket/domain/**,src/openMarket/application/**,src/openMarket/infrastructure/**
alwaysApply: false
